<title>USA: AT&amp;T challenges SNET restructuring.</title>
<headline>AT&amp;T challenges SNET restructuring.</headline>
<dateline>NEW BRITAIN, Conn. 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>AT&amp;T Corp said Wednesday it urged state regulators to reject the proposed restructuring of Southern New England Telecommunications Corp.</p>
<p>The company said SNET's plan to split operations into separate wholesale and retail divisions should not allow it to escape reselling new services to competitors at wholesale rates or submitting to price cap regulation.</p>
<p>The company said it offered testimony to the Connecticut Department of Public Utility Control on SNET's plan.</p>
</text>
